    "",
    "Every fixture states the assumption it was constructed under, as C4-FX-22",
    "requires, in its own `assumption` field. The set as a whole is deliberately",
    "mixed: most cases use a factor of 2 and a round top point and are therefore",
    "dyadic, and c4-fx-01 and c4-fx-06 are the non-dyadic, non-2-fold cases that",
    "keep the arithmetic from being exercised only on values a binary machine",
    "handles exactly. c4-fx-08 is the negative control and raises no flags."
